WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.642 --> 00:00:04.711
- Okay, it is fully on fire (chuckles).

00:00:04.711 --> 00:00:07.711
(happy light music)

00:00:29.104 --> 00:00:30.062
(lighter flint strikes)

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:30.908
(laughs)

00:00:30.908 --> 00:00:32.763
- All right, hold on, I need
to come up with a game plan.

00:00:32.763 --> 00:00:34.582
- I'm gonna go ahead and say
I use all of these items.

00:00:34.582 --> 00:00:36.954
- All right, I feel like all of these now

00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:38.974
are meant to make me think I need them,

00:00:38.974 --> 00:00:40.807
and I don't need them.

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.743
- I was just gonna say
I could just drink it,

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.794
but it is, I haven't
even had breakfast yet.

00:00:45.794 --> 00:00:47.638
- Am I allowed to make this evaporate?

00:00:47.638 --> 00:00:48.874
Does that count?
- I was gonna put all

00:00:48.874 --> 00:00:49.844
the toothpicks on here and maybe

00:00:49.844 --> 00:00:51.002
that would create a barrier,

00:00:51.002 --> 00:00:52.912
but I don't think there's enough.

00:00:52.912 --> 00:00:54.528
- I don't think this is gonna do anything.

00:00:54.528 --> 00:00:57.073
(girl in white shirt chuckles)

00:00:57.073 --> 00:00:59.672
- (sigh) I don't know (laughs).

00:00:59.672 --> 00:01:00.913
- It's impossible.

00:01:00.913 --> 00:01:01.991
Wait, is it impossible?

00:01:01.991 --> 00:01:05.102
- This doesn't make any sense.

00:01:05.102 --> 00:01:07.935
- This looks like it's gonna work.

00:01:09.018 --> 00:01:11.071
(laughs) Not at all.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:11.904
- Uhm, up!

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:14.532
Nope.

00:01:16.802 --> 00:01:17.635
- Ah.

00:01:21.562 --> 00:01:22.395
- Oh.

00:01:24.073 --> 00:01:26.614
- Oh shit, it is on fire.

00:01:26.614 --> 00:01:28.668
(blows)

00:01:28.668 --> 00:01:31.786
- Don't quite know what to do next.

00:01:31.786 --> 00:01:33.045
- I don't wanna light anything,

00:01:33.045 --> 00:01:35.016
I think this is a really bad idea.

00:01:35.016 --> 00:01:38.998
- I really don't know how to
do this, and it makes me mad.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:40.516
- I think I'm done.

00:01:40.516 --> 00:01:41.349
- [Man In Background]
You gotta blow this up.

00:01:41.349 --> 00:01:42.989
(blows)

00:01:42.989 --> 00:01:45.980
- Yeah, I mean, that didn't do anything.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:49.813
(light happy harmonica music)

00:02:07.468 --> 00:02:09.146
- You wanna try it?
- You light it on fire?

00:02:09.146 --> 00:02:10.906
- Yeah.
- I'm not gonna burn myself?

00:02:10.906 --> 00:02:11.842
(lighter flint strikes)

00:02:11.842 --> 00:02:13.442
- Son of a bitch.

00:02:13.442 --> 00:02:14.482
- Ah, it's hot.

00:02:14.482 --> 00:02:15.913
It's really hot!

00:02:15.913 --> 00:02:18.580
- [Man In Background] Go for it.

00:02:21.899 --> 00:02:24.162
(woman laughs)

00:02:24.162 --> 00:02:25.849
(man screams)

00:02:25.849 --> 00:02:28.941
- It's so weird (laughs).

00:02:28.941 --> 00:02:30.512
- Holy shit!

00:02:30.512 --> 00:02:32.410
- Oh, it's hot.

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:35.562
Oh, perfect (chuckles).

00:02:35.562 --> 00:02:37.043
(woman screams)

00:02:37.043 --> 00:02:39.275
This is like fire cupping, you know that,

00:02:39.275 --> 00:02:44.177
like Michael Phelps did that
last year at the Olympics?

00:02:44.177 --> 00:02:45.997
(loud plop)

00:02:45.997 --> 00:02:47.595
- I have a trick now.
- Yeah.

00:02:47.595 --> 00:02:50.845
- Science is crazy, Bill Nye was right.

00:03:02.776 --> 00:03:05.013
(loud whooshing)

